    "Standard deviation per km double levelling (ISO 17123-2): 2.5, 2.0, 1.5, 1.2 and 0.7 mm",
    "Single measurement accuracy at 30 m: 1.5, 1.2, 1.0, 0.8 and 0.4 mm",
    "Magnification 20x, 24x, 28x, 30x and 30x; objective 30, 36, 40, 40 and 40 mm",
    "Shortest target 0.5 m (NA720, NA724), 0.7 m (NA728 and above)",
    "Compensator setting accuracy under 0.5 seconds (NA720, NA724), under 0.3 seconds (NA728, NA730, NA730 plus); tilt area +/- 15 minutes",
    "Circular level 10/2 mm; 360 degree / 400 gon circle; multiplication factor 100, additive constant 0",
    "IP57 submersible, ISO 9022-33-5 drop resistant, operating -20 to +50 degrees C",
